# CountryCodes: an adapter class named by cds.requires.CountryCodes.impl, answering from a mock() (no SOAP call).

@server = http://localhost:4004/soap/countrycodes
@auth = Basic alice:alice


### The mock's rows
GET {{server}}/Countries
Authorization: {{auth}}

### A read by key: the mock filters itself (its answer is final: no in-memory $filter after a mock)
GET {{server}}/Countries/SE
Authorization: {{auth}}
